(7672143, 1252826, 138630, '<td valign="top">I had this much much higher and was one of your 8''s, Ammie.  Maybe it''s not all about the LIGHT in the sense of being light . . . but it''s ALL about the light in the sense of existing only because of what light there is.  Yes, lovely shot and beautiful, subtle light as <img alt="'' . substr(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="https://www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=114285" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Neat</a> and [user]2mmcs[/user] said.</td>', 'I had this much much higher and was one of your 8''s, Ammie.  Maybe it''s not all about the LIGHT in the sense of being light . . . but it''s ALL about the light in the sense of existing only because of what light there is.  Yes, lovely shot and beautiful, subtle light as  Neat and [user]2mmcs[/user] said.', '2020-08-12 10:12:27.000000', NULL, 0),
